## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
# Start the backend
cd backend && uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000

# Test intent parsing (all 3 languages)
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/service-requests \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"text": "Mujhe kal subah G-13 mein AC technician chahiye"}'

# Test English
curl -X POST ... -d '{"text": "I need a plumber in F-10 tomorrow at 9am"}'

# Test clarification flow
curl -X POST ... -d '{"text": "AC chahiye"}'
# Then resume with location
curl -X POST ... -d '{"text": "G-13 mein, kal subah", "conversation_id": "<id>"}'
```

### Manual Verification
- Verify responses are concise (1-2 sentences, not paragraphs)
- Verify Roman Urdu sounds natural (not word-for-word translation)
- Verify booking card renders correctly in UI
- Verify trace timeline shows ReAct reasoning steps
- Test edge cases: no providers found, ambiguous input, Urdu script input
